<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kuberanaga</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">4th century</span> · <a href="/centuries/4th-century">4th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kuberanaga was a princess of the Naga dynasty who married the Gupta emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/chandragupta-ii">Chandragupta II</a> in the late 4th century. Her daughter <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prabhavatigupta">Prabhavatigupta</a> married the Vakataka king <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/rudrasena-ii">Rudrasena II</a> and later ruled the Vakataka kingdom as regent, linking the Gupta, Naga and Vakataka houses.</p></div>
